Lines 3–9 are selected, but we still need to include line 2 above and line 10 below in our selection. We’ll do a click at the start of line 2, then shift-click at the start of line 10 to select lines 2–10, and finally press Tab to indent them all.

```python
import pyautogui, time

# give the editor a moment
time.sleep(0.2)

# click at the start of line 2 (approx. x=350, y=163)
